# Headless example on the transpiled-Haxe backend (no host, no platform link).
# Paths are relative to the repo root — run from there: `node tools/haxe.mjs examples/headless/build.hxml`.
# Swap the pipeline define to retarget: `-D flight_esm` + `-js out.js` for hostWeb,
# or `-cpp out` on a cpp toolchain for native — the source does not change.
-cp src
-cp examples/headless
--main Headless
-D flight_hx
--interp
